    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but can you go into a bit more detail on the chemistry side? I want to explain why the solubility actually drops off once we move above 7.0. Like, what's happening at the molecular level with the iron and manganese that makes them less available to the roots? I need to make sure the client understands the actual mechanism.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
